<title>UK: Jardine Strategic buys up a million shares.</title>
<headline>Jardine Strategic buys up a million shares.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jardine Strategic Holdings Plc, part of the Jardine Matheson empire, said on Wednesday that it bought back one million of its own shares in the market on Tuesday at a price of $3.311 per share.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
